fooyin is a customisable desktop music player. It combines flexible playback,
library management, playlists, and scripting tools in an interface that can
be rearranged from a blank canvas or adapted from preset layouts.

It's built around extensibility and supports plugins for widgets,
decoders, tag readers, DSPs, and integrations, and includes FooScript
for advanced display formatting, queries, autoplaylists, and widget behaviour.
